# DMGAssist list: Mistweaver Monk damage between heals (learned from Method's guide, patch 12.1.5)
# Written by DMGAssist, not SimulationCraft. Rising Sun Kick on cooldown; Tiger Palm builds Teachings of the
# Monastery for Blackout Kick, which can reset Rising Sun Kick. Heals and cooldowns stay the player's call.
actions.precombat=snapshot_stats
actions=rising_sun_kick
actions+=/rushing_wind_kick
actions+=/blackout_kick,if=buff.teachings_of_the_monastery.stack>=3
actions+=/spinning_crane_kick,if=active_enemies>=4
actions+=/tiger_palm
actions+=/blackout_kick
